ser":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-10T09:39:31-07:00","id":622368,"title":"","content":"I'm there with you all: missing those days, not having time to post, not liking being an adult.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-10T09:53:24-07:00","id":622376,"title":"","content":"You poor bastards, with your steady employment and your office chairs.<br /> <br /> I went the smart way: laying around all day writing down things that make me giggle and crawling out at night to say those things in front of strangers for mon- oh, Jesus, am I just a very bad stripper??","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-10T10:08:41-07:00","id":622385,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AzraelFirestorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=622376#post622376\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You poor bastards, with your steady employment and your office chairs.<br /> I went the smart way: laying around all day writing down things that make me giggle and crawling out at night to say those things in front of strangers for mon- oh, Jesus, am I just a very bad stripper??</div> </div> </div> </div>Office chair? I'm on my feet all day.<br /> <br /> And, yes, you're a joke stripper. There's very little difference between the various types of folks who get up on a stage in front of people and expose themselves (in various forms) for money.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-10T19:27:38-07:00","id":623032,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AzraelFirestorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=622376#post622376\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You poor bastards, with your steady employment and your office chairs.<br /> <br /> I went the smart way: laying around all day writing down things that make me giggle and crawling out at night to say those things in front of strangers for mon- oh, Jesus, am I just a very bad stripper??</div> </div> </div> </div>You could very well be a very *good* stripper... so good, in fact, you manage to get people to give you money while keeping all your clothes on.<br /> <br /> That's talent, my good man. <i>Talent</i>...<br /> <br /> *****<br /> <br /> I don't so much miss the old days (the forum back in the 90's, before even Gone was here -- you got here in '99, right?) so much as I marvel at how magical some of those early years were, especially the *very* early years when WoD first came out, before the internet was public. You had to still properly hook up with people at conventions and/or get unofficial newsletters about &quot;x, y and z&quot;. It must have been what it felt like for other Fandom back in the 60's-80's... which, I suppose, makes the very early days of WoD/White Wolf the last time the &quot;old school&quot; way of doing things still happened.<br /> <br /> (It does stand out in my mind, though, how hack-able those early forums were - I still remember the Porn Wars with a chuckle, when people could post god-knows-what, and because it was still the first decade of the internet the posters often were more skilled at post-hacking than the people running the site! Some of the jackasses would post just random, &quot;common&quot; porn, flaming whoever for whatever reasons, but then it escalated after some months to posting *clever* pornographic counter-posts -- ones that weren't merely vulgar, but genuinely clever in terms of imagery, appropriateness relative to a given post/response, and shock-worthy where applicable. It's not so much that I miss those things, in-and-of themselves, but rather how it was so very &quot;Now, *THAT* escalated quickly...&quot; a decade before that was a meme/catch-phrase. Funny times...)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have been around here for waaaayyyy too fucking long...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1433-just-john-forever","name":"Just John, Forever...","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T09:00:07-07:00","id":623363,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=622385#post622385\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Office chair? I'm on my feet all day.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> My apologies. Good news: I can feel bad for you in new ways now!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <br /> And, yes, you're a joke stripper. There's very little difference between the various types of folks who get up on a stage in front of people and expose themselves (in various forms) for money. </div> </div> </div>I'm a whore..<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T09:02:18-07:00","id":623365,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Just John, Forever...</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=623032#post623032\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You could very well be a very *good* stripper... so good, in fact, you manage to get people to give you money while keeping all your clothes on.<br /> <br /> That's talent, my good man. <i>Talent</i>...<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>And now we consummate our love.<br /> <br /> Thorbes! Cover the sex-altar with rose petals, chop chop!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T22:14:28-07:00","id":623929,"title":"","content":"The forums are a lot quieter than they used to be. I really just got back to posting after being gone for ... I dunno, like a year?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/avatar/20th%20Anniversary/2013~Mage%20The%20Ascension/img.php?h=120&amp;w=120&amp;img=1~M20.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1018-ophidimancer","name":"Ophidimancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1018_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"596"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-12T03:44:18-07:00","id":624051,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ophidimancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=623929#post623929\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The forums are a lot quieter than they used to be. I really just got back to posting after being gone for ... I dunno, like a year?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nice to see you back.<br /> <br /> Yeah. Currently hitting 27 and most of the forums I've visited in the past are either dead or in the wasting period. WW/OP forums haven't hit that mark (mostly due to the extensive fanbase) but there is a notable decrease in activity here even with OP actually rebooting the lines.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-12T08:28:32-07:00","id":624385,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=622368#post622368\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm there with you all: missing those days, not having time to post, not liking being an adult.</div> </div> </div> </div>Least we're not alone...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Just John, Forever...</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=623032#post623032\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't so much miss the old days (the forum back in the 90's, before even Gone was here -- you got here in '99, right?) so much as I marvel at how magical some of those early years were, especially the *very* early years when WoD first came out, before the internet was public. You had to still properly hook up with people at conventions and/or get unofficial newsletters about &quot;x, y and z&quot;. It must have been what it felt like for other Fandom back in the 60's-80's... which, I suppose, makes the very early days of WoD/White Wolf the last time the &quot;old school&quot; way of doing things still happened.<br /> <br /> (It does stand out in my mind, though, how hack-able those early forums were - I still remember the Porn Wars with a chuckle, when people could post god-knows-what, and because it was still the first decade of the internet the posters often were more skilled at post-hacking than the people running the site! Some of the jackasses would post just random, &quot;common&quot; porn, flaming whoever for whatever reasons, but then it escalated after some months to posting *clever* pornographic counter-posts -- ones that weren't merely vulgar, but genuinely clever in terms of imagery, appropriateness relative to a given post/response, and shock-worthy where applicable. It's not so much that I miss those things, in-and-of themselves, but rather how it was so very &quot;Now, *THAT* escalated quickly...&quot; a decade before that was a meme/catch-phrase. Funny times...)</div> </div> </div> </div>I was off an on, quietly, back in '99 I think. I didn't really get involved proper until like 2002 or something....<br /> <br /> But yea, I remember those early forums and such. Pretty crazy to look back on it now....<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ophidimancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=623929#post623929\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The forums are a lot quieter than they used to be. I really just got back to posting after being gone for ... I dunno, like a year?</div> </div> </div> </div>Welcome back! Yea, it is much quieter around here it seems... Even I don't post as much as I used to, and I know you remember how much I used to post. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-19T17:59:09-07:00","id":632898,"title":"","content":"Hey Mr. Gone. I recall chatting with you often enough and several e-mails back and forth. I even recall your actual name SHHhhhh... LOL. I kind of miss those days too. Especially because living in Hastings MN now, I have NO gaming friends anymore out here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1707-baldurkhan","name":"Baldurkhan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-20T08:24:34-07:00","id":633499,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baldurkhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=632898#post632898\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey Mr. Gone. I recall chatting with you often enough and several e-mails back and forth. I even recall your actual name SHHh