ess/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-25T22:42:56-07:00","id":639879,"title":"","content":"It's strange that I should find this thread today, just last night something reminded me of all the time I spent voting in the various GOTFT threads on the old forums. I used a different name to post back then and stopped visiting the forums not long after 2e Exalted was released. I also have a copy of The Lonely Winds on a bookshelf. By the way, its great to see that you are still making character sheets Mr. Gone!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3976-silent-witness","name":"Silent Witness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3976_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-26T02:25:49-07:00","id":640009,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ophidimancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=623929#post623929\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The forums are a lot quieter than they used to be. I really just got back to posting after being gone for ... I dunno, like a year?</div> </div> </div> </div>Seemed like longer to me.<br /> <br /> I miss the old mage forum where I posted hundreds of spells in the Creative Thaumaturgy thread. I really respected and apreciated your insight in balancing most of those. Yeah,the mage forums seemed... weid without you around.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-26T02:43:54-07:00","id":640015,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AzraelFirestorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=623365#post623365\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And now we consummate our love.<br /> <br /> Thorbes! Cover the sex-altar with rose petals, chop chop!</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, my! I didn't see that.<br /> <br /> Ok, I'll have everything prepared for when you come back.<br /> <br /> And please do come back, buddy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-26T15:24:13-07:00","id":640699,"title":"","content":"I signed up on the old forums in early 2010 as Paulie Romanov, so I am sort of that last generation of posters, though I was banned from the old forum in the Spring of 2012. I was around 16 the time I joined the White Wolf Forums. While I did get a lot of shit for my ideas on the old forum, I still had a good time on there and had fun. In all honesty, White Wolf Forums was one of the few good memories I have of my high school days. There was some bad, but I think my good experiences on the old board outweighed the bad.<br /> <br /> I spent most of my senior year in high school on the old forums and it helped me get through a bad time in my life. So, despite all the things that went down during those days, both on the forum and in real life, I still cherish my time on the old boards.<br /> <br /> So, all in all, to those who I was friends with on the old White Wolf Forums, thank you. Hell, I'd like to thank the forum in general for giving me good memories and good times both then and now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1579,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","user":"Camilla","date":". 08-26-2015, 06:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-26T18:41:19-07:00","id":640894,"title":"","content":"There is a sharp difference in the atmosphere and culture between the old forums and here...but when I think about whether I should be nostalgic about it or not, I have to pause.<br /> <br /> I mean, don't get me wrong-I loved the old forums. I felt constantly engaged on those forums in a way I don't here. Even when people were <i>wrong</i> about things (and they really could be just straight up wrong), there was something about arguments that was vivifying. It was electric, and I felt involved. I had days where I could sit around just waiting for a counter rebuttal because I wanted to say more and just needed a catalyst. I feel like everyone was just more awake.<br /> <br /> A large part of that <i>was</i> the people there who are no longer with us, who I do really miss-folks like Sikker, Devilfish, Loxo, Demetrius and Omicron being more active, so on and so forth. We had a some really cool, smart, and passionate people. Again, don't get me wrong, I like people in today's forums. They just don't have that edge some of the old crew did.<br /> <br /> <i>That said</i>, it was a fucking contentious time. I mean, nowhere near as bad as, say, 2004 to 2007, and I can't even begin to imagine what pre-2004 White Wolf looked like on the forums. But in comparison to now, it was still a lot more fighting than goes on. There were <i>rivalries</i> between people, something I haven't quite seen here-remember Sikker and Brainbug? There was a lot more straight up meanness going on. I know one of the major goals of the move was to cut down on that to make it a more open community, and for better or for worse, I think it works.<br /> <br /> Also, remember Lady Catherine? Silentblood? Blood Lore? The old forums permitted a lot more dickheadery than this one does, and we had some truly noxious people there who could at least get their shit out there for a while before someone did anything, and some really went the mile with it.<br /> <br /> I suppose what I'm saying is that, while I get times of nostalgia, I don't really miss it. THese forums are, admittedly, more somber and melancholy, but I think that's better than the active contention that went on. I might miss it most when we still have large arguments(Looking at you,Beast the Primordial 0.9 discussion), because while it fits the scale of the old engaging arguments, it just lacks the flavor and zest of the old guard going at it that made it worth it. But on the normal days? Nah.<br /> <br /> There were good times, but I think we're in a better place now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-27T23:01:38-07:00","id":642656,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thorbes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=640015#post640015\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh, my! I didn't see that.<br /> <br /> Ok, I'll have everything prepared for when you come back.<br /> <br /> And please do come back, buddy.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> And still no sex-altar covered in rose petals. Thrones, have I taught you nothing in my dungeon? Has all the whipping and consensual humiliation been for nothing? <br /> <br /> Get that sweet ass moving!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-28T09:58:41-07:00","id":643128,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=640894#post640894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, remember Lady Catherine? Silentblood?</div> </div> </div> </div>I remember having to be constantly on guard for banjumpers, memorizing the writing styles of the banned and analyzing the styles of newbies for comparison. I remember feeling not even like the Secret Police--nothing so noble as that--but like the Secret Police's snitch.<br /> <br /> This forum is a source of sadness for me because of all we have lost, but not everything we've lost has diminished us.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-28T12:18:27-07:00","id":643248,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=643128#post643128\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I remember having to be constantly on guard for banjumpers, memorizing the writing styles of the banned and analyzing the styles of newbies for comparison. I remember feeling not even like the Secret Police--nothing so noble as that--but like the Secret Police's snitch.<br /> <br /> This forum is a source of sadness for me because of all we have lost, but not everything we've lost has diminished us.</div> </div> </div> </div>This. Very much this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-28T17:38:50-07:00","id":643591,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Camilla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=640699#post640699\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I signed up on the old forums in early 2010 as Paulie Romanov, so I am sort of that last generation of posters, though I was banned from the old forum in the Spring of 2012. I was around 16 the time I joined the White Wolf Forums. While I did get a lot of shit for my ideas on the old forum, I still had a good time on there and had fun. In all honesty, White Wolf Forums was one of the few good memories I have of my high school days. There was some bad, but I think my good experiences on the old board outweighed the bad.<br /> <br /> I spent most of my senior year in high school on the old forums and it helped me get through a bad time in my life. So, despite all the things that went down during those days, both on the forum and in real life, I still cherish my time on the old boards.<br /> <br /> So, all in all, to those who I was friends with on the old White Wolf Forums, thank you. Hell, I'd like to thank the forum in general for giving me good memories and good times both then and now.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, hey! I remember you! I guess you did catch some hell on the forums back in the day, didn't you? Sorry about that. I'm glad you at least remember some of the positives too and didn't let any of the crap get you down.<br /> <br /> Glad you're still around!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=640894#post640894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is a sharp difference in the atmosphere and culture between the old forums and here...but when I think about whether I should be nostalgic about it or not, I have to pause.<br /> <br /> I mean, don't get me wrong-I loved the old forums. I felt constantly engaged on those forums in a way I don't here. Even when people were <i>wrong</i> about things (and they really could be just straight up wrong), there was something about arguments that was vivifying. It was electric, and I felt involved. I had days where I could sit around just waiting for a counter rebuttal because I wanted to say more and just needed a catalyst. I feel like everyone was just more awake.<br /> <br /> A large part of that <i>was</i> the people there who are no longer with us, who I do really miss-folks like Sikker, Devilfish, Loxo, Demetrius and Omicron being more active, so on and so forth. We had a some really cool, smart, and passionate people. Again, don't get me wrong, I like people in today's forums. They just don't have that edge some of the old crew did.</div> </div> </div> </div>I totally know what you mean...<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=640894#post640894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>That said</i>, it was a fucking contentious time. I mean, nowhere near as bad as, say, 2004 to 2007, and I can't even begin to imagine what pre-2004 White Wolf looked like on the forums. But in comparison to now, it was still a lot more fighting than goes on. There were <i>rivalries</i> between people, something I haven't quite seen here-remember Sikker and Brainbug? There was a lot more straight up meanness going on. I know one of the major goals of the move was to cut down on that to make it a more open community, and for better or for worse, I think it works.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh yea, I remember that.....<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=640894#post640894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, remember Lady Catherine? Silentblood? Blood Lore? The old forums permitted a lot more dickheadery than this one does, and we had some truly noxious people there who could at least get their shit out there for a while before someone did anything, and some really went the mile with it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll see those names and raise you one: Mordwyr. :P<br /> <br /> That name said, I feel horrible for the way things went down with him and his wife. I had a job to do and I did it. Doesn't mean I liked it. I still think about all that.... I'm kind of glad I'm not a Mod anymore. Just got to be too much stress.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=640894#post640894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I suppose what I'm saying is that, while I get times of nostalgia, I don't really miss it. THese forums are, admittedly, more somber and melancholy, but I think that's better than the active contention that went on. I might miss it most when we still have large arguments(Looking at you,Beast the Primordial 0.9 discussion), because while it fits the scale of the old engaging arguments, it just lacks the flavor and zest of the old guard going at it that made it worth it. But on the normal days? Nah.<br /> <br /> There were good times, but I think we're in a better place now.</div> </div> </div> </div>I guess I miss some of the people more than anything. There were some bad times to be sure, but I think it's the people I miss the most.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=643128#post643128\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I remember having to be constantly on guard for banjumpers, memorizing the writing styles of the banned and analyzing the styles of newbies for comparison. I remember feeling not even like the Secret Police--nothing so noble as that--but like the Secret Police's snitch.</div> </div> </div> </div>Man, I remember those days.... Not fun really.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=643128#post643128\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This forum is a source of sadness for me because of all we have lost, but not everything we've lost has diminished us.</div> </div> </div> </div>Very true...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-31T15:20:04-07:00","id":647280,"title":"","content":"People posting other posters names who aren't around anymore and/or banned got me thinking about when Mordwyr (and, by association, his wife -- who was always a wonderfully polite lady) got banned because his increasingly religious (new-found Catholicism post-baby-saving miracle) views got him posting more and more contentious and ultimately too-flame-ish tirades/arguments with people. It was sad, because I messaged with him privately at least semi-often and he seemed like a good guy, really, but somehow fell into a religious-fueled level of asshole-ness that was just a let down compared to the other years he had posted in the 00's. I miss Isobelle (his wife), by association, as although she was not banned (she was perhaps the most courteous poster ever across all the incarnations of this forum), she of course decided to not post here anymore in deference to her husband being banned. I guess what saddened me about it wasn't the things he posted (they never bothered me, personally, because I never got into an argument with him), but rather watching a person -- who, albeit, I had only discussed things with online, as he and Isobelle were ex-pats living in Japan -- slowly over a period of a couple or so years lose the open-mindedness that he once had in favor of a level of religious fanaticism that just... was just disheartening. (Gone, and Ophid -- I believe -- should remember Mordwyr and Isobelle....)<br /> <br /> I also had a nasty moment just as I was going to type this second paragraph wherein I was going to talk about a poster/Admin who I had liked to discuss things with (though others knew him better), but unfortunately his Real Life(tm) was too much for him and he committed suicide back in the 00's... only to realize that I had a &quot;feeling&quot; of him, a &quot;flavor&quot;, and a sense of our conversations... but I'd now forgotten his post-name. I knew it even a year ago, but it has slipped my mind now, completely. It's sad because of someone having ended their own life, in the broader aspect, and personally sad because now I realize I've forgotten his name.<br /> <br /> Not so happy memories....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have been around here for waaaayyyy too fucking long...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1433-just-john-forever","name":"Just John, Forever...","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-31T15:40:04-07:00","id":647325,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Just John, Forever...</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=647280#post647280\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mordwyr (and, by association, his wife -- who was always a wonderfully polite lady) got banned because his increasingly religious (new-found Catholicism post-baby-saving miracle) views got him posting more and more contentious and ultimately too-flame-ish tirades/arguments with people.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is that how it went down? I thought it was that he started calling women in the Babes thread fat and ugly, so he got a tempban which he circumvented to spam the forums (while pretending he was doing it for our own good to show us where the holes in security are), which earned him a permaban. I'm not sure about the Babes bit, but I'm quite positive about the spam.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Just John, Forever...</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=647280#post647280\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd now forgotten his post-name.</div> </div> </div> </div>Michael Dracon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-31T17:09:50-07:00","id":647404,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=647325#post647325\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Just John, Forever...</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=647280#post647280\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mordwyr (and, by association, his wife -- who was always a wonderfully polite lady) got banned because his increasingly religious (new-found Catholicism post-baby-saving miracle) views got him posting more and more contentious and ultimately too-flame-ish tirades/arguments with people.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is that how it went down? I thought it was that he started calling women in the Babes thread fat and ugly, so he got a tempban which he circumvented to spam the forums (while pretending he was doing it for our own good to show us where the holes in security are), which earned him a permaban. I'm not sure about the Babes bit, but I'm quite positive about the spam.</div> </div> </div> </div>It was both. I'm with John, It was kind of sad to watch... Of course, I ended up taking some of the brunt of his anger and tirades. But, I guess that happens sometimes...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=647325#post647325\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Just John, Forever...</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=647280#post647280\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd now forgotten his post-name.</div> </div> </div> </div>Michael Dracon.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yup! I miss him. For quite awhile him and I were the only two Mods. Then for a bit it was just me... I still think about him sometimes....<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-31T17:50:57-07:00","id":647455,"title":"","content":"Aw. Big hugs, Gone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-31T22:21:59-07:00","id":647682,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thorbes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=640009#post640009\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Seemed like longer to me.<br /> <br /> I miss the old mage forum where I posted hundreds of spells in the Creative Thaumaturgy thread. I really respected and apreciated your insight in balancing most of those. Yeah,the mage forums seemed... weid without you around.</div> </div> </div> </div>Aww ... well I'm back now and I fully intend to start a Creative Thaumaturgy Thread when 2ed hits.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=640894#post640894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, remember Lady Catherine? Silentblood? Blood Lore?</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bHoo boy, yes.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=643591#post643591\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm kind of glad I'm not a Mod anymore. Just got to be too much stress.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, me too.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Just John, Forever...</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=647280#post647280\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Gone, and Ophid -- I believe -- should remember Mordwyr and Isobelle....)</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh boy, yes I do. I had some really good conversations with him, actually, despite him being really kind of offensive. All I can say is he truly meant well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/avatar/20th%20Anniversary/2013~Mage%20The%20Ascension/img.php?h=120&amp;w=120&amp;img=1~M20.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1018-ophidimancer","name":"Ophidimancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1018_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"596"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-31T22:41:17-07:00","id":647692,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=647325#post647325\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Michael Dracon.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, god -- thank you! It was really bugging me that I couldn't remember. I kept going &quot;was it Dragon-something?&quot;, but knew that wasn't it -- obviously the Dracon was coming up, though obviously shifted a little. Thank you for the reminder! I wish it were something that didn't need reminding vis-a-vis his still being around and posting (i.e. still alive and with us). Just disheartening....<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have been around here for waaaayyyy too fucking long...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1433-just-john-forever","name":"Just John, Forever...","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-31T22:47:34-07:00","id":647694,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ophidimancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=647682#post647682\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh boy, yes I do. I had some really good conversations with him, actually, despite him being really kind of offensive. All I can say is he truly meant well.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I remember some of them. Up until he got a little too fanatical, it was great to just read his posts concerning religion and metaphysics.<br /> <br /> In Re: the Babes thing -- yeah, I forgot about that until it was just brought up (I remember more so the religious nigh-flame discussions because they were far more numerous by comparison and therefore more memorable, at least for me...). I thought that was really strange of him to make some of the comments he did; that is, it &quot;sounded&quot;/read like him, essentially, but it was like &quot;dude -- are you drunk/high?&quot;. It was just so counter to many of the things/views he had indicated just a couple years earlier. But anywho... enough bad memories.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have been around here for waaaayyyy too fucking long...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1433-just-john-forever","name":"Just John, Forever...","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-01T04:58:14-07:00","id":647863,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Just John, Forever...</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=647692#post647692\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just disheartening...</div> </div> </div> </div>Forgetting is the only way people can move on, sometimes.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-01T09:48:26-07:00","id":648099,"title":"","content":"Not necessarily missed, but something I remember happening a lot on the old forums and I don't really see it much now. Maybe I'm juts not hanging out in the right areas of the forums.<br /> <br /> The newbies who come on and are so excited about this <i><b>brilliant </b></i>idea they've had about how to play WOD and it usually involved vampires walking about in the day and hanging out with the mages and the werewolves and how they all band together to fight the forces of darkness. They talk about it like no one has ever thought of anything<i><b> this cool </b></i>before, and while the enthusiasm could be appreciated, the rest of us were just kind of over that. A few would go on about how they're missing the themes and moods of the games doing that. Others would be more blase about it, &quot;If that's how you want to play, okay, have fun.&quot;. You'd get those trying to explain how they were playing &quot;wrong&quot;.<br /> <br /> But they usually ended badly with the newbie going off in a huff about how no one thought it was as cool as they did or they'd keep going on about it, trying to convince everybody else it was the best way to play the game <u><i><b>EVAR!!!!</b></i></u><br /> <br /> Don't see those much any more.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-01T09:58:10-07:00","id":648111,"title":"","content":"we saw a lot of that in Exalted as well &quot;Hey guys I fixed paranoia combat!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-01T11:39:33-07:00","id":648202,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=648111#post648111\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">we saw a lot of that in Exalted as well &quot;Hey guys I fixed paranoia combat!&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh yeah, still get those, but not as many: &quot;I fixed Generation/Power Balance/Hunter/&lt;&lt;insert their pet peeve here&gt;&gt;!!!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-01T11:50:51-07:00","id":648224,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=648099#post648099\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not necessarily missed, but something I remember happening a lot on the old forums and I don't really see it much now. Maybe I'm juts not hanging out in the right areas of the forums.<br /> <br /> The newbies who come on and are so excited about this <i><b>brilliant </b></i>idea they've had about how to play WOD and it usually involved vampires walking about in the day and hanging out with the mages and the werewolves and how they all band together to fight the forces of darkness. They talk about it like no one has ever thought of anything<i><b> this cool </b></i>before, and while the enthusiasm could be appreciated, the rest of us were just kind of over that. A few would go on about how they're missing the themes and moods of the games doing that. Others would be more blase about it, &quot;If that's how you want to play, okay, have fun.&quot;. You'd get those trying to explain how they were playing &quot;wrong&quot;.<br /> <br /> But they usually ended badly with the newbie going off in a huff about how no one thought it was as cool as they did or they'd keep going on about it, trying to convince everybody else it was the best way to play the game <u><i><b>EVAR!!!!</b></i></u><br /> <br /> Don't see those much any more.</div> </div> </div> </div>Er ... don't look now, but a certain semitic arachnid is kinda spewing that type of thing all over the Mage forum.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/avatar/20th%20Anniversary/2013~Mage%20The%20Ascension/img.php?h=120&amp;w=120&amp;img=1~M20.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1018-ophidimancer","name":"Ophidimancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1018_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"596"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-01T11:56:09-07:00","id":648231,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ophidimancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=648224#post648224\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Er ... don't look now, but a certain semitic arachnid is kinda spewing that type of thing all over the Mage forum.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, I did preface it with &quot;maybe I'm not going into those forums&quot;. And anyone choosing to name themselves after that character cannot be taken seriously.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-01T12:11:29-07:00","id":648237,"title":"","content":"Huh ... didn't even know that was a character. Learn something new every day.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/avatar/20th%20Anniversary/2013~Mage%20The%20Ascension/img.php?h=120&amp;w=120&amp;img=1~M20.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1018-ophidimancer","name":"Ophidimancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1018_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"596"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-02T04:31:17-07:00","id":648741,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=647455#post647455\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aw. Big hugs, Gone.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks man. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=648099#post648099\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not necessarily missed, but something I remember happening a lot on the old forums and I don't really see it much now. Maybe I'm juts not hanging out in the right areas of the forums.<br /> <br /> The newbies who come on and are so excited about this <i><b>brilliant </b></i>idea they've had about how to play WOD and it usually involved vampires walking about in the day and hanging out with the mages and the werewolves and how they all band together to fight the forces of darkness. They talk about it like no one has ever thought of anything<i><b> this cool </b></i>before, and while the enthusiasm could be appreciated, the rest of us were just kind of over that. A few would go on about how they're missing the themes and moods of the games doing that. Others would be more blase about it, &quot;If that's how you want to play, okay, have fun.&quot;. You'd get those trying to explain how they were playing &quot;wrong&quot;.<br /> <br /> But they usually ended badly with the newbie going off in a huff about how no one thought it was as cool as they did or they'd keep going on about it, trying to convince everybody else it was the best way to play the game <u><i><b>EVAR!!!!</b></i></u><br /> <br /> Don't see those much any more.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah yea...I guess we don't see that as much these days. But I remember stuff like that. I always tried to be nice to them...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-21T19:07:09-07:00","id":673739,"title":"","content":"Well, it's nice to see some familiar faces around. I got burned out by being a mod and playing the never ending game of who's a ban jumper today* too. Damn near ended up flaming out actually, so I decided to take some time off from the forum entirely. Now I'm back more or less. Exalted 3rd edition is coming. No way I'm not gonna be here for that. <br /> <br /> *The answer was far too often half the new people logging in on any given day in the Exalted forum.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">They call me... Mr. Demmywinks.</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1210-demetrius7997","name":"Demetrius7997","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1210_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-22T10:48:22-07:00","id":674390,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Demetrius7997</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=673739#post673739\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, it's nice to see some familiar faces around. I got burned out by being a mod and playing the never ending game of who's a ban jumper today* too. Damn near ended up flaming out actually, so I decided to take some time off from the forum entirely. Now I'm back more or less. Exalted 3rd edition is coming. No way I'm not gonna be here for that.<br /> <br /> *The answer was far too often half the new people logging in on any given day in the Exalted forum.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey! Welcome back! I just got back a little while ago, too!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/avatar/20th%20Anniversary/2013~Mage%20The%20Ascension/img.php?h=120&amp;w=120&amp;img=1~M20.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1018-ophidimancer","name":"Ophidimancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1018_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"596"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-22T21:18:28-07:00","id":674922,"title":"","content":"I just lurked like a lurky-lurkypants for almost a decade and then finally found the energy to make a new profile. Couldn't remember my password after that time. The new forums are weirdly fresh for me, probably due to old usual lurking, so that's probably why seeing folks who I've essentially been passively hanging out with for years still posting makes me happy.<br /> <br /> It honestly hurts that I'm seeing great minds, fun personalities and kind hearts leave us. I know it's happened before, like a mass beaching of whales. I've watched it happen too many times on the old WW forums, so it's not surprising. It just never fails to bother me. Maybe I don't deal with loss well. I dunno.<br /> I'm just glad the people who stick around, and the new faces who genuinely want to be part of this community, are here.<br /> <br /> Hey Gone! Had a memory I thought you'd get a mild smirk out of:<br /> <br /> \u200bThe first piece of computer hardware I've operated and destroyed, that started literally smoking as it burnt out, was a printer in high school. Why was it smoking? Apparently it couldn't handle the volume of your character sheets I was aiming to print. Don't worry. I was never caught and I still managed to getabout 50 sheets before the thing went poof. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> ....What kind of kid was I that I'd broken in after school to print character sheets in my teacher's office? ... O_0","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-23T16:28:51-07:00","id":675785,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Demetrius7997</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=673739#post673739\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, it's nice to see some familiar faces around. I got burned out by being a mod and playing the never ending game of who's a ban jumper today* too. Damn near ended up flaming out actually, so I decided to take some time off from the forum entirely. Now I'm back more or less. Exalted 3rd edition is coming. No way I'm not gonna be here for that.<br /> <br /> *The answer was far too often half the new people logging in on any given day in the Exalted forum.</div> </div> </div> </div>Welcome back man! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AzraelFirestorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=674922#post674922\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey Gone! Had a memory I thought you'd get a mild smirk out of:<br /> <br /> \u200bThe first piece of computer hardware I've operated and destroyed, that started literally smoking as it burnt out, was a printer in high school. Why was it smoking? Apparently it couldn't handle the volume of your character sheets I was aiming to print. Don't worry. I was never caught and I still managed to getabout 50 sheets before the thing went poof. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> ....What kind of kid was I that I'd broken in after school to print character sheets in my teacher's office? ... O_0</div> </div> </div> </div>Ha! Thats awesome! Poor printer. hee hee. Well, least it died for a good cause. :P<br /> <br /> Guess the security was lax there? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-24T19:41:38-07:00","id":677184,"title":"","content":"Yeah I remember the old days back when I went by the forum name Lodaren. I remember some of the good, the bad, and especially the weird. Very few forums had the sheer variety and creativity of the old WW board. That legacy is very much alive and well here though so it's cool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3065-nist498","name":"Nist498","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3065_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-24T22:21:01-07:00","id":677310,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=675785#post675785\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Welcome back man! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Ha! Thats awesome! Poor printer. hee hee. Well, least it died for a good cause. :P<br /> <br /> Guess the security was lax there? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It died for the cause. My friends and I later stole it before it was replaced and burned it with thermite...because thermite...but it was an honorable thermite death of volcanic horror. We were like that.<br /> <br /> And no, security was great. I just had the keys to everything, being a Teacher's Assistant, Theater Technician, Junior Librarian and a friend of unscrupulous janitors.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-25T15:54:46-07:00","id":678132,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AzraelFirestorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=677310#post677310\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It died for the cause. My friends and I later stole it before it was replaced and burned it with thermite...because thermite...but it was an honorable thermite death of volcanic horror. We were like that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Man, that story just gets better and better!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AzraelFirestorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/621709-b-i-flight-and-old-forum-nostalgia?p=677310#post677310\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue an